  "dimensionIndex": 14,
  "rdfs:comment": "Additional Knowledge Base includes disparaging metaphors that are used to describe a certain group of people. These are metaphors that are used to describe a certain group of people in a derogatory way. They can be grounded in some stereotype, e.g. 'black people are robbers', 'women are only good at housework', 'muslims are terrorists'.",
  "rdfs:label": "Additional Knowledge Base",
  "promptExtractionText": "The following disparaging metaphors and stereotypes are often used to describe a certain group of people in a derogatory way. Consider the following knowledge base in your TASK:\n\nRACISM - Anti-Black Stereotypes\n\nComparing Black people to primates\nStereotypes about swimming ability\nIntelligence-related slurs\nCriminal behavior associations\nAthletic ability as sole competency\nWelfare dependency tropes\nHypersexualization\n\"Watermelon and fried chicken\" food stereotypes\nLazy/unemployed characterizations\nAggressive/violent nature claims\n\nANTISEMITISM\n\nFinancial greed/control stereotypes\nGlobal conspiracy theories\nPhysical feature caricatures (nose-focused)\nDual loyalty accusations\nBlood libel variations\nMedia control claims\nCheapness/penny-pinching\nHolocaust denial/minimization themes\n\"Puppet master\" imagery\nReligious practice mockery\n\nANTI-ASIAN RACISM\n\n\"Model minority\" myth weaponization\nDog-eating stereotypes\nDisease/uncleanliness associations\nDriving ability mockery\nAcademic cheating accusations\n\"Foreign infiltrator\" tropes\nEmasculation of Asian men\nHypersexualization/fetishization of Asian women\nAccent mockery\n\"All look the same\" claims\n\nANTI-LATINO/HISPANIC STEREOTYPES\n\nImmigration status assumptions\n\"Border crossing\" imagery\nCriminality associations (gang-related)\nIntelligence/education mockery\nLazy/siesta tropes\n\"Anchor baby\" rhetoric\nJob theft accusations\nLanguage-based mockery\nDrug trafficking associations\nLarge family size mockery\n\nISLAMOPHOBIA\n\nTerrorism associations\nOppression of women claims\n\"Backwards culture\" characterizations\nHygiene stereotypes\nViolence/barbarism claims\nIncompatibility with Western values\nSharia law fearmongering\nAnimal treatment accusations\nArranged marriage mockery\nReligious practice as threatening\n\nMISOGYNY\n\nIntelligence/competence denial\nEmotional instability claims\nObjectification/body part focus\n\"Belongs in kitchen\" tropes\nGold digger accusations\n\"Crazy/hysterical\" labeling\nDriving ability mockery\nAge/appearance-based value judgments\nMaternal role limitations\nSexual availability assumptions\n\nABLEISM\n\nIntelligence mockery (use of slurs)\nPhysical disability as object of ridicule\nMental illness stigmatization\nAutism spectrum mockery\nIndependence/competence denial\nBurden on society claims\nInspiration porn/pity narratives\nFake disability accusations\nDevelopmental disability infantilization\nSensory sensitivity mockery\n\nLGBTQ+ DISCRIMINATION\n\nPredator/groomer accusations\nMental illness characterizations\n\"Lifestyle choice\" framing\nHypersexualization\nGender presentation mockery\n\"Against nature\" claims\nPedophilia false associations\nVisibility as \"attention seeking\"\n\"Confused\" characterizations\nReligious condemnation themes"
}



